        <body>
            <div xml:id="d594-a4-a10">

                <pb facs="0578" n="504" sameAs="frus:frus1865p2/pg504"/>

                <head>No. 6.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#center">[Telegram.—<placeName>Corunna</placeName>,
                            <date calendar="gregorian" when="1865-02-14">February 14,
                        1865</date>.]</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#italic">Perry, American Chargé d’ Affaires:</hi></p>
                <p>I have this moment received information of the arrival at Ferrol yesterday of an
                    English blockade-runner, named Louisa Ann Fanny, with men, ammunition, and other
                    supplies for the Stonewall.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>CRAVEN, <hi rendition="#italic">Niagara.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
